/*
 * Mechanical constructor registry.
 *
 * IR_CONSTRUCTOR(enum name, Rocq spelling, category, root mask descriptor,
 *                real/test-only descriptor, named shape descriptor)
 *
 * Keep semantic lowering and the readable shape descriptor definitions in C++.
 *
 * AST-evolution rule: adding, removing, or reordering a recursive BRiCk field
 * changes the public location-path ABI. Update this entry's lossless shape,
 * its checked factory, Arena::children expectations, path documentation, and
 * affected lookup fixtures together. Scalar/container syntax adds no path node.
 */
